      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5706259::web::014::3_4_tribological_properties"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer lowers abrasive interactions during sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5706259::web::014::3_4_tribological_properties"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-formed oxide layer will maintain its integrity throughout room-temperature-to-800 °C sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-forming the film will minimize uncontrolled oxidation kinetics during wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to untreated CoCrFeNi, pre-oxidized CoCrFeNi will have a lower and more stable coefficient of friction across the full temperature range.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC5706259::web::014::3_4_tribological_properties"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relative to untreated CoCrFeNi, pre-oxidized CoCrFeNi will have a reduced specific wear rate across the full temperature range.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC5706259::web::014::3_4_tribological_properties"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
